          "lines": [
            "          281 Tingkauh Jubilee Kaeng",
            "                         9.9.8.8.Ref. 8. 8. 8.9",
            "          Doh hei Eb",
            "",
            "          1. Tingkauh Jubilee kaeng khwan \"king o,",
            "             Taek dat mak khe hiw bammei khwan tei,",
            "             Paapc phunghmei nunc mu chu thưy lak',",
            "             \"Kingna guang tho, nyan pwni the.",
            "",
            "                       Tat nimei tingkauh ramc khou kiu,",
            "                       Tingsaeng neihlaa mbaanvthay ni,",
            "                       Kaamcthau di kho, 'zianmei nunc le,",
            "                       Tingkauh Jubilee kaeng khwan 'kingna.",
            "",
            "          2. 'Thei han dat ri tho, lwmloumei guay,",
            "             Kandih hei mu zinghpui bamv di the,",
            "             Kap kalanghmei rui zingc sihnic,",
            "             'Kauh Jubilee kaeng khwan 'king o.",
            "",
            "          3. Tangc zai pwni the, tingkauh ramc kiu,",
            "             How zaic ni the, Kaipou Khrista lwn,",
            "             Hallelujah ! Samc kan ni the",
            "             Tingkauh Guangc Jubilee Ngai khang'."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
